      "y": 92,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50.550000000000004,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "FIG. 1 illustrates the modular, decoupled system topology comprising per-client adapters,\ntwo separate message capture paths, a local Brain Daemon, graph/vector persistence,\nand a user-facing memory control panel bound to 127.0.0.1.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FIG. 1 illustrates the modular, decoupled system topology comprising per-client adapters,\ntwo separate message capture paths, a local Brain Daemon, graph/vector persistence,\nand a user-facing memory control panel bound to 127.0.0.1.",
