      "height": 50.550000000000004,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "FIG. 5 illustrates working-memory state tracking via Session\u2192[LOADED]\u2192Artifact edges, token burden\nestimation, smart deduplication with relevance demotion, refresher reinjection gating, and Session\nHandoff Intelligence that seeds a new session with the prior session's top loaded artifacts.",
