      "y": 3348,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50.550000000000004,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "FIG. 6 illustrates multi-signal routing fusion computing a confidence score from semantic intent,\nentity overlap, and workspace context; threshold-based quest attachment; LLM escalation for\nambiguous cases; and prediction-error reconsolidation via Long-Term Depression (LTD).",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
