      "text": "FIG. 7 illustrates use-based pathway strengthening, exponential time-decay pruning, archive mechanics,\nembedding-similarity resurrection, and promotion of implicit CO_OCCURS_WITH edges to named semantic\nrelationship edges via Hebbian Long-Term Potentiation.",
